## Summary
Cyber Security 101 a beginner friendly TryHackMe learning path that builds core foundations needed to start a career in cybersecurity.
Covers essential topics including Linux and Windows fundamentals, Active Directory Basics, Networking, Cryptography, also an introduction to both 
offensive (red team) and defensive (blue team) security concepts and tools.
The path is designed to give learners a broad, practical understanding of the field before they specialise.

